     "fcf040": 0.6847
    },
    "breakthrough": "Wj71Q12o FCF0.40*gap0.60 prod=0.6847 ACTIVE/OS",
    "note": "FCF 镜像与 pattern gap 镜像互相关 -0.02，是稀释分量；阈值恰在 FCF 0.40-0.42 之间"
   },
